# behavior: a test file receives the fixtures of every `conftest.incn` from its directory up to `tests/`, a nearer conftest's fixture depending on a farther one's, `yield` conftest fixtures tearing down after the test, as 0.5.1 does (#3149).
# cli-commands:
#   test tests --nocapture
# expect-stdout-contains:
#   conftest close
#   test_nested.incn::test_parent_conftest PASSED
#   test_nested.incn::test_both_conftests PASSED
#   test_nested.incn::test_conftest_yield PASSED

